### Tuquet Automa Runner - Browser Profiles & Lifecycle Isolation
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8765
@contentType = application/json

### 4.1 Danh sach tat ca Browser Profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers

### 4.2 Tao Browser Profile moi
# @name createProfile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Dev Automation Profile",
  "browserType": "chromium",
  "headless": false
}

### 4.3 Xem chi tiet Browser Profile theo ID
@targetProfileId = {{createProfile.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/{{targetProfileId}}

### 4.4 Mo trinh duyet truc tiep (Manual session voi Custom URL)
# @name startSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/{{targetProfileId}}/session
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "headless": false,
  "startUrl": "https://www.google.com"
}

### 4.5 Dong phien trinh duyet manual
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/{{targetProfileId}}/session

### 4.6 Don sach tat ca tien trinh Chromium dang chay
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/sessions

### 4.7 Xoa Browser Profile
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/{{targetProfileId}}

### 4.8 Negative Test - Truy van Browser Profile khong ton tai (Expect 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/non-existent-profile-uuid
